{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別本影下有外\n字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按經原文有小異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十則"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按：宗學或作字學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十則"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十則"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "風病"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十則"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九十三首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曾燒六指，聞杜鵑有省。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禾禾混同者非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為璵書記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鏞讀柳氏塔銘曰：師拈提勤正，答辨朗烈，至於中竺，四眾雲委，夏席不能容，谿谷流聲，山\n林動色，真若隰州古佛之為法，重見于世云云。師之行業，是亦略耳，憾未見全文，錄以竢後賢之補墜逸。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鼓山永覺錄和尚繼燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "泰定甲子八月二十二日端然而逝，世壽八十三，僧臘六十五。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道\n鏞"}
